DESCRIPTION:https://dev.transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-82230\n\nFriday 11 December\nFrom 2:50PM\, buses replace trains from Wollongong to Bomaderry.\nFrom 3:50PM\, buses replace trains from Bomaderry to Wollongong.\nTrains run between Port Kembla\, Wollongong and Bondi Junction\, some to a changed timetable.\nBuses do not run to the train timetable. If connecting with trains at Wollongong\, you may need to catch an earlier bus to ensure you meet your train connection.
